    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A bullet-ridden action-adventure experience where you kill robots by smashing them with a flying guitar.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Send your guitar flying</strong> across various stages to defeat robots. But make sure to dodge your own attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obtain upgrades and powerups</strong> to make your journey easier - and make yourself unstoppable.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a storyline which isn't quite what it seems.</strong> There may be more to this world than meets the eye...</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, here we go. You guys probably aren\u2019t gonna believe me, but it\u2019s worth a shot\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, my name\u2019s Eve. I\u2019m a musician. This is me, <strong>smashing some robots with an electric guitar: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/e3578b4b4ac35eb3f2f75b1ffcd79988.poster.avif?t=1749432795\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/e3578b4b4ac35eb3f2f75b1ffcd79988.webm?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/e3578b4b4ac35eb3f2f75b1ffcd79988.mp4?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You see, my life used to be normal. But one day, I just couldn't take it anymore. I got on a bus and rode as far away as possible from everything and everyone with the hopes of somehow making it as a musician. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/9f5a6a3525df428cc12208cfdc619415.poster.avif?t=1749432795\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/9f5a6a3525df428cc12208cfdc619415.webm?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/9f5a6a3525df428cc12208cfdc619415.mp4?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then\u2026 and this is where I\u2019ll probably lose you, but seriously, I\u2019m telling the truth\u2026 this flying guitar showed up and sent me on a time-bending adventure in order to save the galaxy from an evil music-hating sorceress in the future.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/6f9f96f879ac9871ab04a792512bb484.poster.avif?t=1749432795\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/6f9f96f879ac9871ab04a792512bb484.webm?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/6f9f96f879ac9871ab04a792512bb484.mp4?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pretty soon I\u2019m smashing robots with a flying guitar and <strong>dodging bullet-hell projectiles</strong>, wielding countless <strong>upgrades and powerups</strong> to aid my journey\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and, see, that\u2019s just the thing. All my life, I\u2019ve been dodging bullets. I\u2019ve been stumbling forwards blindly without a plan, only focused on dodging the attacks of others rather than taking control of myself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/eb3dda4d5e702cc4d1dae494787fad9d.poster.avif?t=1749432795\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/eb3dda4d5e702cc4d1dae494787fad9d.apng?t=1749432795\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=127 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, I\u2019m back now, after traveling through time saving the galaxy and shredding some awesome tunes along the way. And, well\u2026 I guess I could type out my experience in some blog post or something, but nobody would believe me. So instead, here\u2019s this game I made, just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I promise it\u2019s pretty neat. I did go to some pretty exotic places in my travels, after all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/4a3a47f279bc6ab22efb8322515ac7e6.poster.avif?t=1749432795\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/4a3a47f279bc6ab22efb8322515ac7e6.webm?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/4a3a47f279bc6ab22efb8322515ac7e6.mp4?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/83845c5b1c6c53e3fd87f6e0e16c6d4f.poster.avif?t=1749432795\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/83845c5b1c6c53e3fd87f6e0e16c6d4f.webm?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/83845c5b1c6c53e3fd87f6e0e16c6d4f.mp4?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyways. That\u2019s just my  story. The story of <strong>THE GIRL WITH THE GUITAR.</strong></p>",
