n, only focused on dodging the attacks of others rather than taking control of myself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/eb3dda4d5e702cc4d1dae494787fad9d.poster.avif?t=1749432795\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/eb3dda4d5e702cc4d1dae494787fad9d.apng?t=1749432795\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=127 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, I\u2019m back now, after traveling through time saving the galaxy and shredding some awesome tunes along the way. And, well\u2026 I guess I could type out my experience in some blog post or something, but nobody would believe me. So instead, here\u2019s this game I made, just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I promise it\u2019s pretty neat. I did go to some pretty exotic places in my travels, after all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/4a3a47f279bc6ab22efb8322515ac7e6.poster.avif?t=1749432795\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/4a3a47f279bc6ab22efb8322515ac7e6.webm?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/4a3a47f279bc6ab22efb8322515ac7e6.mp4?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/83845c5b1c6c53e3fd87f6e0e16c6d4f.poster.avif?t=1749432795\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/83845c5b1c6c53e3fd87f6e0e16c6d4f.webm?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572630/extras/83845c5b1c6c53e3fd87f6e0e16c6d4f.mp4?t=1749432795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyways. That\u2019s just my  story. The story of <strong>THE GIRL WITH THE GUITAR.</strong></p>",
